      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NELLY ALWAYS (5) flew the lids and led throughout to get off the mark with her maiden win, then finished a 4 length fourth last start at this track over 300m (17.47). Can make amends this time. WATCHING BIRDS (6) held her own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only 2 lengths (17.35) behind All For Del at this track. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Expected to be in this for a long way. ASHLEY KEEPING (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (22.61) in a Novice race at Cannington. Great chance to atone. SPARE ME (2) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
